Start at Successor 1 [FlowControl, exit]
To move the MUs on to the first available successor, select Start at Successor 1 from the drop-down list.
Remarks
The FlowControl checks the successors starting with the successor with the number 1. It moves the MU on
to successor number 3, for example, if it cannot move it on to successor 1 and 2. As long as the successor
with the number 1 can receive MUs, the FlowControl always moves them to it.
