Cyclic [FlowControl, entry]
To cyclically receive the MUs from all predecessors, select Cyclic from the drop-down list.
Remarks
Proceed as follows:
• Select Blocking 
  to make the FlowControl only receive the MU from the predecessor which
immediately follows the predecessor from which it received the last MU.
• Clear Blocking 
  to make the FlowControl only receive the MU from the first predecessor which
is ready to move a MU on and which immediately follows the predecessor from which it received the last
MU.
Once the FlowControl reaches the end of the list of its predecessors, it restarts the search at the beginning.
