Start at Predecessor 1
To receive the MUs from the first available predecessor, starting with the predecessor with the number 1,
select Start at Predecessor 1 from the drop-down list.
Remarks
The FlowControl only receives a MU from predecessor 3, for example, when predecessor 1 and 2 cannot
deliver one.
SimTalk
